DESCRIPTION:Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone\n(46.9)\n\nAventure\, 
 Fantastique\n𝟮𝗵𝟯𝟯\n\nUnited Kingdom\, United States of America
 \n(English)\n(sortie initiale : 05/12/2001)\n\n𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘀
 𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿 : Chris Columbus\n𝗦𝗰𝗲𝗻𝗮𝗿𝗶𝗼 : 
 Steve Kloves\n𝗣𝗵𝗼𝘁𝗼𝗴𝗿𝗮𝗽𝗵𝗶𝗲 : John Seal
 e\n𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗱𝘂𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 : Warner Bros. Pictures\, Heyd
 ay Films\, 1492 Pictures\n\n𝗔𝗰𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿𝘀 :\n- Daniel Radcl
